dc11:date a owl:AnnotationProperty.
dc11:description a owl:AnnotationProperty.
dc11:format a owl:AnnotationProperty.
dc11:language a owl:AnnotationProperty.
dc11:publisher a owl:AnnotationProperty.
dc11:title a owl:AnnotationProperty.
<http://www.essepuntato.it/2009/10/error/hasError> a owl:DatatypeProperty.
owl:Thing a owl:Class.
